; The Mirage link proof.
;
; This executable names the offline closure and no transport. If tron-types,
; tron-crypto, tron-proto, tron-transaction or tron-rpc ever acquires a Unix,
; Lwt or socket dependency -- directly, or through something they depend on --
; this stops linking. That is the check; running it is a bonus.
;
; It is deliberately an ordinary native executable rather than a Solo5 image.
; Cross-compiling to sptmac is a separate, heavier exercise with its own
; unresolved question (GMP), recorded in ../../docs/unikernel.md. This target
; answers the question that can be answered on every CI runner, on every
; commit, from the first milestone rather than at release time.

(executable
 (name unikernel)
 (libraries
  tron-types
  tron-crypto
  tron-proto
  tron-transaction
  tron-rpc
  yojson))
